      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BET ON POLLY NZ (1) is a newcomer to the Darren Elder yard from NZ where she was a Manawatu winner last campaign. Has not raced for four-and-a-half months but was readied with two nice trials, winning the latest here. The ace draw gives her the chance to kick off with a win. LAURIE DEE (9) produced a very good effort last time at Tamworth, racing parked but sticking on for third and just 1.4 metres from the winner. Draws to trail the top pick and if he gets the gaps could challenge. HEEZ REASONABLE (3) goes up in grade but must be respected after winning two of his last four starts, both from wider draws than this. MISTER BRILLANTE (8) may need luck from a wide barrier but showed pleasing improvement last time out when third from the back line.",
